  "title": [
    "[Elemental Confluence]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Protrusions of craggy rock arise from gurgling lakes of lava.  The surrounding terrain is composed of flat rock penninsulas that extend into the fiery pools, their surfaces cracked in glowing red fractals.  Overhead, billowing clouds trap the heat like a smothering blanket."
